T("Geometry & angles","Sides and corners","Count them on flat shapes",function(){var s=pick([["triangle",3],["square",4],["rectangle",4],["pentagon",5],["hexagon",6]]),w=pick(["sides","corners"]);return Q("How many "+w+" does a "+s[0]+" have?",s[1],"A "+s[0]+" has "+s[1]+" sides and "+s[1]+" corners.");});
T("Geometry & angles","Solid shapes","Count the flat faces",function(){var s=pick([["cube",6],["box (rectangular prism)",6],["square pyramid",5],["cylinder",2],["cone",1]]);return Q("How many flat faces does a "+s[0]+" have?",s[1],"A "+s[0]+" has "+s[1]+" flat face"+(s[1]===1?"":"s")+".");});
