T("Fractions & decimals","Equal fractions","Like 1/2 = ?/8",function(){var d=pick([2,3,4,5]),k=R(1,d-1),m=R(2,5);return Q(k+"/"+d+" = ?/"+(d*m)+sm("What is the missing top number?"),k*m,"The bottom was multiplied by "+m+", so multiply the top by "+m+" too: "+k+" "+X+" "+m+" = "+(k*m)+".");});
T("Fractions & decimals","Hundredths as decimals","Like 37/100 = 0.37",function(){var k=R(1,99);return Q("Write "+k+"/100 as a decimal",k/100,k+" hundredths is written "+(k/100)+".");});
T("Fractions & decimals","Adding tenths","Like 0.4 + 0.3",function(){var a=R(1,9),b=R(1,9);return Q((a/10)+" + "+(b/10),dec((a+b)/10,1),a+" tenths + "+b+" tenths = "+(a+b)+" tenths, which is "+dec((a+b)/10,1)+".");});
T("Patterns & equations","Skip counting","Count by 25s, 50s and 100s",function(){var s=pick([25,50,100,20]),a=R(0,8)*s;return Q([a,a+s,a+2*s].join(", ")+", ?",a+3*s,"The numbers go up by "+s+" each time. "+(a+2*s)+" + "+s+" = "+(a+3*s)+".");});
T("Patterns & equations","Missing number","Like ? + 27 = 60",function(){var a=R(10,60),b=R(10,60);if(R(0,1))return Q("? + "+a+" = "+(a+b),b,"Take away to find it: "+(a+b)+" "+M+" "+a+" = "+b+".");return Q("? "+M+" "+a+" = "+b,a+b,"Add to find it: "+b+" + "+a+" = "+(a+b)+".");});
T("Patterns & equations","Number patterns","Going up or going down",function(){var d=R(3,12),up=R(0,1),a=up?R(1,30):R(60,120),s=up?d:-d;return Q([a,a+s,a+2*s,a+3*s].join(", ")+", ?",a+4*s,"Each number is "+d+(up?" more":" less")+" than the one before. The next is "+(a+4*s)+".");});
T("Geometry & angles","Sides and corners","Count them on flat shapes",function(){var s=pick([["triangle",3],["square",4],["rectangle",4],["pentagon",5],["hexagon",6],["octagon",8]]),k=R(1,4),w=pick(["sides","corners"]);if(k===1)return Q("How many "+w+" does a "+s[0]+" have?",s[1],"A "+s[0]+" has "+s[1]+" sides and "+s[1]+" corners.");return Q("How many "+w+" do "+k+" "+s[0]+"s have in all?",k*s[1],"One "+s[0]+" has "+s[1]+" "+w+". "+k+" "+X+" "+s[1]+" = "+(k*s[1])+".");});
T("Geometry & angles","Turns and right angles","Quarter, half and full turns",function(){var t=pick([["a quarter turn",90],["a half turn",180],["a three-quarter turn",270],["a full turn",360]]),k=R(1,4);if(R(0,1))return Q("How many degrees is "+t[0]+"?",t[1],"A full turn is 360°. "+t[0].charAt(0).toUpperCase()+t[0].slice(1)+" is "+t[1]+"°.");return Q("How many degrees are in "+k+" right angle"+(k>1?"s":"")+"?",k*90,"One right angle is 90°. "+k+" "+X+" 90 = "+(k*90)+"°.");});
T("Geometry & angles","Lines of symmetry","Fold it so both halves match",function(){var s=pick([["a square",4],["a rectangle that is not a square",2],["a triangle with three equal sides",3],["a regular pentagon",5],["a regular hexagon",6],["the capital letter A",1],["the capital letter H",2]]);return Q("How many lines of symmetry does "+s[0]+" have?",s[1],"A line of symmetry splits a shape into two matching halves. "+s[0].charAt(0).toUpperCase()+s[0].slice(1)+" has "+s[1]+".");});
T("Measurement","Perimeter of shapes","Add up all the sides",function(){var t=R(0,2),a=R(3,20),b=R(3,20),c=R(3,20);if(t===0)return Q("A square has sides of "+a+" cm."+sm("What is its perimeter in cm?"),4*a,"A square has 4 equal sides: 4 "+X+" "+a+" = "+(4*a)+".");if(t===1){if(c>=a+b)c=a+b-1;return Q("A triangle has sides of "+a+" cm, "+b+" cm and "+c+" cm."+sm("What is its perimeter in cm?"),a+b+c,a+" + "+b+" + "+c+" = "+(a+b+c)+".");}return Q("A rectangle is "+a+" cm long and "+b+" cm wide."+sm("What is its perimeter in cm?"),2*(a+b),"Two lengths and two widths: "+a+" + "+b+" + "+a+" + "+b+" = "+(2*(a+b))+".");});
T("Measurement","Litres and millilitres","1 L = 1,000 mL",function(){var k=R(1,9),h=R(1,9)*100;if(R(0,1))return Q("How many millilitres in "+k+" litres?",k*1000,k+" "+X+" 1,000 = "+com(k*1000)+".");return Q("How many millilitres in "+k+" L and "+h+" mL?",k*1000+h,k+" L is "+com(k*1000)+" mL. Add "+h+": "+com(k*1000+h)+".");});
T("Measurement","Hours and minutes","1 hour = 60 minutes",function(){var h=R(1,5),m=pick([0,10,15,20,30,45]);if(m===0)return Q("How many minutes in "+h+" hour"+(h>1?"s":"")+"?",h*60,h+" "+X+" 60 = "+(h*60)+".");return Q("How many minutes in "+h+" h "+m+" min?",h*60+m,h+" "+X+" 60 = "+(h*60)+". Add "+m+": "+(h*60+m)+".");});
T("Data & probability","Mode","The number that shows up most",function(){var m=R(1,9),o=shuffle([1,2,3,4,5,6,7,8,9].filter(function(z){return z!==m;})).slice(0,3),a=shuffle([m,m,m,o[0],o[1],o[2],o[0]]);return Q("Mode of "+a.join(", "),m,m+" appears 3 times, more than any other number.");});
T("Data & probability","Spinner chances","Chance as a fraction",function(){var tot=pick([4,5,6,8,10]),r=R(1,tot-1),s=fr(r,tot);return Q("A spinner has "+tot+" equal parts. "+r+" "+(r===1?"is":"are")+" red."+sm("What is the chance of landing on red? Answer as a fraction in simplest form"),r/tot,"Red parts over all parts: "+r+"/"+tot+(s!==r+"/"+tot?" = "+s:"")+".",s,true);});
T("Financial literacy","Adding money","Dollars and cents",function(){var a=R(20,999)*5,b=R(20,999)*5;return Q("$"+(a/100).toFixed(2)+" + $"+(b/100).toFixed(2)+sm("How many dollars?"),dec((a+b)/100),"Line up the decimal points and add: "+((a+b)/100).toFixed(2)+".");});
T("Financial literacy","Change from $10","What you get back",function(){var c=R(21,199)*5;return Q("You pay with a $10 bill for something that costs $"+(c/100).toFixed(2)+"."+sm("How many dollars do you get back?"),dec((1000-c)/100),"10.00 "+M+" "+(c/100).toFixed(2)+" = "+((1000-c)/100).toFixed(2)+".");});
T("Financial literacy","Counting coins","Toonies, loonies and quarters",function(){var t=R(0,4),l=R(0,4),q=R(1,7),v=t*200+l*100+q*25;return Q(t+" toonie"+(t===1?"":"s")+", "+l+" loonie"+(l===1?"":"s")+" and "+q+" quarter"+(q===1?"":"s")+sm("How many dollars in all?"),v/100,"Toonies: $"+(t*2)+". Loonies: $"+l+". Quarters: $"+(q*25/100).toFixed(2)+". Total $"+(v/100).toFixed(2)+".");});

